```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant Dev
    participant CostExplorer as Cost Anomaly Detection
    participant SNS
    participant Admin
    
    Dev->>AWS: Launches 10 x p4d.24xlarge (GPU Instances)
    AWS-->>AWS: Cost incurs rapidly
    CostExplorer->>CostExplorer: ML Model detects spike vs baseline
    CostExplorer->>SNS: Publish Anomaly Alert
    SNS->>Admin: Email / PagerDuty Alert
    Admin->>AWS: Stops instances & adjusts IAM limits
```
